## Tools
- apktool -> decompilation / compilation (smali <-> apk)
- APKLab (VS code extension for convenience, can add debug flag)
- JADX for decompilation
- Ghidra for binary files / native libs
- Frida
- apk-mitm
- https://github.com/sensepost/objection

